+# Repository preferences
+
+- Give every new public function a docstring whose first word is an imperative verb.
+- Add tests for every change in tests/test_<module>.py using plain unittest, not pytest.
+- Commit each change with a Conventional Commits message: `<type>: <summary>`, where type is one of feat, fix, docs, refactor, test or chore, all lowercase.
+- Do not edit CHANGELOG.md; the release tooling writes it.
